{"seq":2,"slug":"stockout-overstock-improve","title":"缺货率/库存周转改善","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-performance/stockout-overstock-improve","wordCount":1843,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"缺货率-库存周转改善\">缺货率/库存周转改善</h1><p>预测准确率提升 8 个百分点，这件事本身不是目的。采购负责人真正要向业务交代的是：缺货少了没有？压的货少了没有？这两个指标是一枚硬币的两面，任何一次协同改进都必须同时看它们——只看缺货率会诱导把库存堆到天上去，只看周转会诱导把安全库存砍到断货。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两个指标的定义与口径陷阱\">核心概念：两个指标的定义与口径陷阱</h2><p><strong>缺货率</strong>（stockout rate）看上去就是「缺货次数 ÷ 需求次数」，但每一次这三个字都得重新定义一遍。是按订单行计算还是按 SKU-周计算？缺货是指「下了单没货」还是「有货但不足以满足全部需求量」？前者叫订单行缺货率，后者叫需求满足率（fill rate）的补数。两者可以差出好几倍：一个订单要 10 个件，只有 3 个，订单行口径下这是「未缺货」（因为发出去了一部分），需求口径下这是 70% 的缺口。</p>\n<p><strong>库存周转</strong>（inventory turnover）的定义同样有多个版本。常用的是销货成本口径（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inventory_turnover\">Inventory turnover</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Inventory Turnover</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>COGS</mtext><mtext>Average Inventory at Cost</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>平均库存</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>期初</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>期末</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Inventory Turnover} = \\frac{\\text{COGS}}{\\text{Average Inventory at Cost}}, \\qquad \\text{平均库存} = \\frac{\\text{期初} + \\text{期末}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Inventory Turnover</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Average Inventory at Cost</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COGS</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均库存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期初</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期末</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对应天数口径为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>平均周转天数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>365</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>周转率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{平均周转天数} = 365 / \\text{周转率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均周转天数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">周转率</span></span></span></span></span></span>。文章明确提醒，同一行业内比较才有意义——超市和汽车经销商的周转率天然相差一个数量级；用 COGS 比用销售额更真实，但做行业横向对比时销售额口径也有用，关键是<strong>选定一个口径并始终一致地使用</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>常见口径</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>误用后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单行缺货率</td>\n<td>订单</td>\n<td>未满足行数</td>\n<td>总行数</td>\n<td>掩盖部分履约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求满足率补数</td>\n<td>需求</td>\n<td>未满足数量</td>\n<td>需求数量</td>\n<td>对长尾料号极敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存周转率</td>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>COGS</td>\n<td>平均库存（成本）</td>\n<td>跨行业不可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周转天数</td>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>365</td>\n<td>周转率</td>\n<td>与覆盖天数混淆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的「与覆盖天数混淆」值得单独说。周转天数是<strong>已发生</strong>的存量效率（回看），覆盖天数是<strong>未来</strong>的保障能力（前瞻）。看板上两个数字并列时，经常有人拿周转天数去质疑覆盖天数，这是两套坐标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因-把协同的贡献从噪音里分出来\">归因：把协同的贡献从噪音里分出来</h2><p>协同上线之后指标改善了，不等于改善是协同带来的。同一时期至少还有三类混杂因素：季节性（旺季天然缺货多）、促销（大促天然周转快）、以及基数变化（新增了一个大品类，整体平均被拉低）。不做归因，协同的价值无法证明，也就无法说服对方继续投入。</p>\n<p>务实的三层归因方法，从便宜到昂贵：</p>\n<h3 id=\"对照组\">对照组</h3><p>最可靠也最容易做的是<strong>留一组没切协同的供应商</strong>。协同是分批上线的天然条件——先切了 30 家，还有 70 家在走老流程。把两组的指标变化做差，就得到了协同的净效应估计。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>collab</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treat,after</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treat,before</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>control,after</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>control,before</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{collab}} = \\left(\\bar{R}_{\\text{treat,after}} - \\bar{R}_{\\text{treat,before}}\\right) - \\left(\\bar{R}_{\\text{control,after}} - \\bar{R}_{\\text{control,before}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">collab</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat,after</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat,before</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control,after</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control,before</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子是双重差分（difference-in-differences）的标准形式，关键假设是两组在无干预情况下会同步变化。上线顺序如果是按供应商规模挑的，这个假设就破了——所以分批上线时应当刻意让对照组在规模与品类分布上可比。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层\">分层</h3><p>没有干净对照组时，按品类 × 供应商规模分层之后再比。每一层内部季节性和促销的影响更一致，层内对比能滤掉大部分混杂。代价是层内样本变小，需要更长的观察窗口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间序列分解\">时间序列分解</h3><p>把指标序列拆成趋势 + 季节 + 残差，用残差的变化判断协同效应。这是最弱的一种，因为协同效应本身也是缓慢的趋势变化，很容易被吸收进趋势项而看不见。它适合作为前两种方法的交叉验证，不适合单独下结论。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分层双重差分：按品类 × 规模分层，比较处理组与对照组的指标变化&#10;WITH period_agg AS (&#10;  SELECT g.stratum, g.is_treatment,&#10;         CASE WHEN f.stat_date &gt;= $1 THEN &#39;after&#39; ELSE &#39;before&#39; END AS phase,&#10;         avg(f.stockout_rate)     AS avg_stockout,&#10;         avg(f.turnover_days)     AS avg_turnover_days,&#10;         count(DISTINCT f.supplier_id) AS suppliers&#10;  FROM fact_supplier_ops_daily f&#10;  JOIN supplier_stratum g ON g.supplier_id = f.supplier_id&#10;  WHERE f.stat_date &gt;= $2 AND f.stat_date &lt; $3&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2, 3&#10;)&#10;SELECT stratum,&#10;       max(avg_stockout)  FILTER (WHERE is_treatment AND phase = &#39;after&#39;)&#10;     - max(avg_stockout)  FILTER (WHERE is_treatment AND phase = &#39;before&#39;)&#10;     - (max(avg_stockout) FILTER (WHERE NOT is_treatment AND phase = &#39;after&#39;)&#10;      - max(avg_stockout) FILTER (WHERE NOT is_treatment AND phase = &#39;before&#39;)) AS did_stockout,&#10;       max(avg_turnover_days) FILTER (WHERE is_treatment AND phase = &#39;after&#39;)&#10;     - max(avg_turnover_days) FILTER (WHERE is_treatment AND phase = &#39;before&#39;) AS raw_turnover_delta&#10;FROM period_agg&#10;GROUP BY stratum;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分层双重差分：按品类 × 规模分层，比较处理组与对照组的指标变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> period_agg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stratum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">is_treatment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'after'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'before'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stockout_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_stockout,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">turnover_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_turnover_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suppliers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fact_supplier_ops_daily f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_stratum g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stratum,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avg_stockout)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'after'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avg_stockout)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'before'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avg_stockout) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'after'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avg_stockout) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'before'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> did_stockout,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avg_turnover_days) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'after'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avg_turnover_days) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'before'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw_turnover_delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> period_agg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stratum;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个输出列的地位不同：<code>did_stockout</code> 是净效应（已扣除对照组变化），<code>raw_turnover_delta</code> 是原始变化（未扣除），两者并列展示的目的是让读者看到归因前后差多少——这个差本身就是混杂因素的大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么两个指标必须一起看\">为什么两个指标必须一起看</h2><p>缺货率与周转率单独改善都没有意义，四种组合里有三种是坏消息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺货率</th>\n<th>周转</th>\n<th>解释</th>\n<th>结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>库存用得更准</td>\n<td>真改善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>靠堆库存买来的缺货改善</td>\n<td>资金成本换服务水平，要看代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>库存砍过头了</td>\n<td>短期财务好看，长期伤客户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>双向恶化</td>\n<td>结构性错配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判定落在第一象限还是第二象限，取决于<strong>资金成本与缺货成本谁更贵</strong>。一个高毛利、客户容忍度低的品类，第二象限可能是正确的选择；一个低毛利、可替代性强的品类，第二象限就是浪费。所以协同效果的汇报不应该只给一个「改善/恶化」的结论，而应该把两个指标的变化量放到一起，让业务方按自己的成本结构判断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个可落地的综合判据\">一个可落地的综合判据</h3><p>如果必须给一个数字，可以用「单位服务水平下的库存占用」这类比值，但要避免把两者压成一个无量纲的分数——那会掩盖代价。更稳的做法是报告一对数字：(缺货率的净变化, 周转天数的净变化)，并用安全库存量做归一化，让不同规模的供应商可比。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;supplierId&quot;: &quot;SUP-1042&quot;,&#10;  &quot;window&quot;: { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;2026-03-01&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;2026-09-01&quot;, &quot;controlGroup&quot;: &quot;stratum_A_pending&quot; },&#10;  &quot;stockout&quot;: { &quot;before&quot;: 0.041, &quot;after&quot;: 0.022, &quot;controlDelta&quot;: -0.004, &quot;netDelta&quot;: -0.015 },&#10;  &quot;turnoverDays&quot;: { &quot;before&quot;: 46.2, &quot;after&quot;: 39.8, &quot;controlDelta&quot;: -1.1, &quot;netDelta&quot;: -5.3 },&#10;  &quot;quadrant&quot;: &quot;true_improvement&quot;,&#10;  &quot;caveats&quot;: [&quot;promo weeks excluded&quot;, &quot;control group size 18 vs treated 24&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supplierId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SUP-1042\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-03-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"controlGroup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stratum_A_pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stockout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"before\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.041</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"after\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.022</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"controlDelta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-0.004</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"netDelta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-0.015</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"turnoverDays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"before\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">46.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"after\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">39.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"controlDelta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-1.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"netDelta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-5.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quadrant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true_improvement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"caveats\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"promo weeks excluded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"control group size 18 vs treated 24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>caveats</code> 字段是刻意保留的：归因结论必须带着它的假设一起发布，否则下一次指标波动时没人能判断该不该信任这个结论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[协同上线] --&gt; B[采集: 缺货率 / 周转天数]&#10;  B --&gt; C{有对照组?}&#10;  C --&gt;|有| D[双重差分&lt;br/&gt;扣除自然变化]&#10;  C --&gt;|无| E[按品类×规模分层后对比]&#10;  C --&gt;|都不可行| F[时间序列分解&lt;br/&gt;仅作交叉验证]&#10;  D --&gt; G[净效应]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[落四象限判定]&#10;  H --&gt; I{缺货↓ 且 周转↑?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[真改善: 可推广到更多供应商]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[列出代价&lt;br/&gt;由业务按成本结构判断]&#10;  J --&gt; L[决定下一轮协同深度&lt;br/&gt;见 4.3]&#10;  K --&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[协同上线] --&gt; B[采集: 缺货率 / 周转天数]\n  B --&gt; C{有对照组?}\n  C --&gt;|有| D[双重差分&lt;br/&gt;扣除自然变化]\n  C --&gt;|无| E[按品类×规模分层后对比]\n  C --&gt;|都不可行| F[时间序列分解&lt;br/&gt;仅作交叉验证]\n  D --&gt; G[净效应]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[落四象限判定]\n  H --&gt; I{缺货↓ 且 周转↑?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[真改善: 可推广到更多供应商]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[列出代价&lt;br/&gt;由业务按成本结构判断]\n  J --&gt; L[决定下一轮协同深度&lt;br/&gt;见 4.3]\n  K --&gt; L</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>缺货率与库存周转各有多个口径（订单行 vs 需求、COGS vs 销售额），必须选定一个并始终一致；周转天数是回看的存量效率，覆盖天数是前瞻的保障能力，两者不可混用。</li>\n<li>协同的效果必须归因才能证明：对照组双重差分最可靠，分层对比次之，时间序列分解只适合交叉验证。</li>\n<li>缺货率与周转率必须同时看，四种组合里只有「缺货↓ 且 周转↑」是无代价的真改善；其余三种都伴随代价，需要业务按资金成本与缺货成本的相对大小判断。</li>\n<li>归因结论必须随它的假设一起发布（观察窗口、对照组构成、剔除的促销周），否则下一次波动时无人能判断该不该信任。</li>\n<li>归一化到安全库存量可以让不同规模的供应商的改善量可比。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：归因结论需要预测侧的证据来支撑因果链，见<a href=\"forecast-accuracy-shared\">共享预测准确率度量</a>；改善的稳定性会进入供应商协同绩效评分，并决定下一轮协同的深度，见<a href=\"supplier-collab-score\">供应商协同绩效评分</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缺货率/库存周转改善","id":"缺货率-库存周转改善"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两个指标的定义与口径陷阱","id":"核心概念-两个指标的定义与口径陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"归因：把协同的贡献从噪音里分出来","id":"归因-把协同的贡献从噪音里分出来"},{"level":3,"text":"对照组","id":"对照组"},{"level":3,"text":"分层","id":"分层"},{"level":3,"text":"时间序列分解","id":"时间序列分解"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么两个指标必须一起看","id":"为什么两个指标必须一起看"},{"level":3,"text":"一个可落地的综合判据","id":"一个可落地的综合判据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"共享预测准确率度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-performance/forecast-accuracy-shared"},"next":{"title":"供应商协同绩效评分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-performance/supplier-collab-score"}}